  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qsly](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qsly) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 51.899 depth occurred on Aug 30 2025 99 km SE of Lata, Solomon Islands. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -11.4554 longitude 166.3239. It impacted 777 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
